       relay which isn't public refuses is counted before it is answered. Part
       of ticket 41339.
+    - Count the tunneled directory requests on BEGIN_DIR streams that arrived
+      while their circuit already had DoSBeginDirMaxStreams open directory
+      streams, by what they asked for, as
+      tor_relay_begindir_request_over_max_total. While DoSBeginDirLimitEnabled
+      is off, these are the requests it would refuse. Part of ticket 41339.
